  },
  {
    name: '企业微信',
    chineseName: 'WeCom',
    description: '真正好用的私域工具。1对1聊天、人群分层、自动触达，直连7.5亿+微信用户。多数品牌都吃亏在动手太慢。',
    image: '/images/platforms/wechat-ecosystem/wecom.png',
    bg: '#1A1A1A',
    iconBg: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.1)',
    textColor: '#FFFFFF',
    descColor: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.6)',
    linkColor: '#CC3333',
    icon: `<svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#CC3333" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"/></svg>`,
  },
  {
    name: '朋友圈',
    chineseName: 'Moments',
    description: '每天十几亿人在这里刷熟人动态。品牌广告像朋友发的一条状态一样出现，做品牌曝光最快的一块地。',
